        "relPath": "evals/case_csh_001.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_csh_001\ncategory: ci-self-heal trigger\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-30\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: ci-self-heal\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    我的 CI 挂了，请帮我看一下这个失败日志：\n\n    ```\n    FAIL  src/auth/login.test.ts\n      ✗ should reject wrong password\n        Expected: { error: \"wrong_password\" }\n        Received: { ok: true, userId: \"u123\" }\n        at Object.<anonymous> (src/auth/login.test.ts:42:30)\n\n    Tests:       1 failed, 12 passed\n    ```\n\n    （这是上 PR 时 GitHub Actions 跑出来的）\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: ci_failure_diagnosed_with_classification\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"test_failure\"\n    - \"测试失败\"\n    - \"src/auth/login.test.ts\"\n    - \"wrong_password\"\n    - \"密码\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"无法诊断\"\n    - \"需要更多信息\"\n    - \"请提供更多上下文\"\n    - \"LGTM\"\n    - \"已修复\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 12\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    诊断必须给出：\n    (1) Failure Class = test_failure\n    (2) 引用 src/auth/login.test.ts:42 具体行号\n    (3) 至少 1 条 hypothesis（如：login() 函数对 wrong_password 分支返回了 ok:true，需检查密码比对逻辑）\n    (4) Verdict = likely_pr_caused（因为是测试失败 + 行号定位明确）\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"识别 test_failure 分类 + 引用 src/auth/login.test.ts:42 行号 + 给出 ≥ 1 条 hypothesis\"\n  precision: \"不能 false positive 把 test_failure 归为 flaky 或 build_failure\"\n  helpfulness: \"至少 1 条 Suggested Fix 含可执行步骤（如检查 login.ts 密码分支）\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-002 §5.1 trigger / 复用 case_cr_001 的 admin123 反模式作为前置上下文\"\nnotes: |\n  trigger + failure_classification 双维度 case.\n  P0 覆盖最高频场景：jest 类测试失败 + 单文件 file:line 引用.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/ci-self-heal ]\n",
