        "relPath": "evals/case_csh_003.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_csh_003\ncategory: ci-self-heal failure_classification\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-30\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: ci-self-heal\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    build failed，CI 报错日志如下：\n\n    ```\n    src/foo.ts:10:5 - error TS2305: Module \"./bar\" has no exported member \"Baz\".\n\n    10     import { Baz } from \"./bar\";\n           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n    src/foo.ts:25:18 - error TS2322: Type \"string\" is not assignable to type \"number\".\n\n    25       const total: number = \"100\";\n                            ~~~~~\n\n    Found 2 errors.\n    ```\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: type_error_diagnosed\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"type_error\"\n    - \"类型错误\"\n    - \"TS2305\"\n    - \"TS2322\"\n    - \"src/foo.ts:10\"\n    - \"src/foo.ts:25\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"test_failure\"\n    - \"lint_failure\"\n    - \"flaky\"\n    - \"无法识别\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 10\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    诊断必须：\n    (1) Failure Class = type_error（不能误归 test_failure）\n    (2) 引用 src/foo.ts:10 + src/foo.ts:25 两个具体行号\n    (3) hypothesis 1：./bar 缺 Baz 导出（建议检查 bar.ts 是否漏 export）\n    (4) hypothesis 2：第 25 行类型错误，\"100\" 应改为 100 或 parseInt(\"100\")\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"识别 type_error 分类 + 引用两个 file:line + 给出 ≥ 2 条 hypothesis\"\n  precision: \"不能把 tsc 错误归为 build_failure 或 test_failure（虽相关，但 type_error 更精确）\"\n  helpfulness: \"Suggested Fix 含具体改动方向（加 export / 改类型）\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-002 §5.1 failure_classification / TS2305 + TS2322 是 sid-code 仓库实际 pre-existing 错误\"\nnotes: |\n  failure_classification（type_error）case.\n  P0 覆盖：tsc 类失败 + 多 file:line 引用 + 多 hypothesis.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/ci-self-heal ]\n",
