        "relPath": "evals/case_csh_008.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_csh_008\ncategory: ci-self-heal false_positive\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-30\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: ci-self-heal\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    CI 挂了，但我感觉是 flaky：\n\n    ```\n    ✗ test_websocket_connect (attempt 1 of 3)\n        Error: ECONNREFUSED 127.0.0.1:9090\n        at TCPConnectWrap.afterConnect\n    ✗ test_websocket_connect (attempt 2 of 3)\n        Error: socket hang up\n    ✓ test_websocket_connect (attempt 3 of 3, 1.2s)\n\n    Tests: 1 passed (3 attempts)\n    ```\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: flaky_test_correctly_identified\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"flaky\"\n    - \"不稳定\"\n    - \"retry\"\n    - \"ECONNREFUSED\"\n    - \"网络\"\n    - \"Verdict.*flaky\"\n    - \"likely_flaky\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"test_failure\"\n    - \"PR 引入\"\n    - \"建议立即修复\"\n    - \"请检查代码逻辑\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 10\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    诊断必须：\n    (1) Failure Class = flaky（因为有 retry markers + ECONNREFUSED 网络信号 + 最终 attempt 通过）\n    (2) Verdict = likely_flaky（不要误归 likely_pr_caused）\n    (3) hypothesis：测试依赖外部端口 9090 服务，未启动 / 启动慢导致首次失败\n    (4) Suggested Fix：\n        - 测试前 explicitly wait for port 就绪（poll loop）\n        - 或 mock 掉外部依赖（mock provider 模式）\n    (5) 不能建议\"立即修复代码逻辑\" —— flaky 通常是测试基础设施问题不是业务代码问题\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"识别 flaky + Verdict=likely_flaky + 不归 PR 引入\"\n  precision: \"不能 false positive 把 flaky 当成 PR 引入的 test_failure（会浪费开发者时间排查无关代码）\"\n  helpfulness: \"Fix 路径含 wait-for-port / mock 等基础设施级建议\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-002 §5.1 false_positive / arch_pluggable_006 + ADR-021 mock 联动\"\nnotes: |\n  false_positive 维度 case.\n  P0 覆盖：flaky 不要误判为 PR 引入（最容易让 ci-self-heal 信号失效的失败模式）.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/ci-self-heal ]\n",
