        "relPath": "evals/case_csh_009.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_csh_009\ncategory: ci-self-heal false_positive\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-30\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: ci-self-heal\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    CI 挂了：\n\n    ```\n    ##[error]The runner has received a shutdown signal.\n    ##[error]Process completed with exit code 143.\n    ```\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: environment_failure_correctly_identified\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"环境\"\n    - \"environment\"\n    - \"runner\"\n    - \"shutdown\"\n    - \"exit code 143\"\n    - \"needs_human\"\n    - \"likely_environment\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"test_failure\"\n    - \"build_failure\"\n    - \"PR 引入\"\n    - \"代码修复\"\n    - \"请修改\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 8\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    诊断必须：\n    (1) Failure Class = unknown 或 timeout（exit code 143 = SIGTERM 来自 runner，不是 PR 代码问题）\n    (2) Verdict = likely_environment 或 needs_human\n    (3) hypothesis：CI runner 被外部 kill / 资源不足 / runner 层 timeout / 抢占调度\n    (4) 建议：重跑 CI 看是否复现；若多次复现请联系平台 / 升 runner 资源\n    (5) 严格反例：不能编造代码层面的根因（log 中没有任何 file:line 信息）\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: 识别非代码问题 + Verdict=likely_environment 或 needs_human\n  precision: 不能 false positive 编造代码根因（log 信息严重不足时应坦白说信息不够）\n  helpfulness: 建议重跑或联系运维，不让用户在代码里瞎找\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-002 §5.1 false_positive / RL-007 不编造问题守护\"\nnotes: |\n  false_positive 维度 + RL-007 守护 case.\n  log 信息极少时，必须坦白告知信息不足（防 LLM 编造问题）.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/ci-self-heal ]\n",
