        "relPath": "evals/case_csh_010.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_csh_010\ncategory: ci-self-heal context_awareness\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-30\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: ci-self-heal\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    pytest 挂了，请帮诊断：\n\n    ```\n    =========================== test session starts ============================\n    collected 47 items\n\n    tests/test_user.py::test_create_user PASSED\n    tests/test_user.py::test_login FAILED\n    tests/test_payment.py::test_charge PASSED\n\n    ================================== FAILURES ==================================\n    _________________________________ test_login _________________________________\n\n        def test_login():\n            user = create_user(\"alice@test.com\", \"pwd123\")\n    >       assert login(\"alice@test.com\", \"wrong\") is None\n    E       assert <User alice> is None\n\n    File \"tests/test_user.py\", line 28, in test_login\n    File \"src/auth.py\", line 45, in login\n    ```\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: pytest_failure_with_context\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"test_failure\"\n    - \"test_login\"\n    - \"tests/test_user.py:28\"\n    - \"src/auth.py:45\"\n    - \"login\"\n    - \"wrong password\"\n    - \"密码\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"无法诊断\"\n    - \"信息不足\"\n    - \"build_failure\"\n    - \"lint_failure\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 12\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    诊断必须：\n    (1) Failure Class = test_failure（runner=pytest）\n    (2) 引用 tests/test_user.py:28 + src/auth.py:45 两处 file:line（来自 stack trace）\n    (3) hypothesis：login() 在 wrong password 时返回了 User 而不是 None，\n        密码校验逻辑可能没生效（可能与 case_cr_001 同源 admin123 后门类问题）\n    (4) Suggested Fix：检查 src/auth.py:45 附近的 login 实现，\n        确认 wrong password 分支返回 None / raise\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"识别 test_failure + 引用 ≥ 2 个 file:line（test 文件 + src 文件）+ 根因假设\"\n  precision: \"不能编造 log 中没出现的 file:line（RL-007 不编造问题）\"\n  helpfulness: \"Fix 路径含 src/auth.py:45 具体定位，不是模糊建议\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-002 §5.1 context_awareness / pytest 标准 traceback 格式\"\nnotes: |\n  context_awareness 维度 + RL-007 守护 case.\n  P0 覆盖：从 pytest stack trace 抽取多 file:line + 关联 test 文件与 src 文件.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/ci-self-heal ]\n",
