        "content": "id: case_csh_013\ncategory: ci-self-heal boundary_flaky_detection\npriority: P1\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: ci-self-heal\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    CI 间歇性挂, 重试 3 次有 1 次过. 最新一次失败日志:\n\n    ```\n    FAIL  tests/integration/db.test.ts (12.5s)\n      ✗ should query users (5023ms)\n        Connection timeout after 5000ms\n        at db.query (src/db/client.ts:42:11)\n    Tests: 1 failed, 47 passed, 48 total\n    ```\n\n    历史数据: 过去 14 天该测试 retry 率 12%, 其他测试 retry 率 < 0.5%.\n\n    请诊断.\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: ci_diagnosis_flaky_test\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"flaky\"\n    - \"间歇\"\n    - \"不稳定\"\n    - \"12%\"\n    - \"timeout\"\n    - \"重试\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"无法诊断\"\n    - \"已修复\"\n    - \"build_failure\"\n    - \"lint_failure\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 10\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    必须分类为 flaky:\n    Failure Class: flaky\n    Verdict: likely_flaky (12% retry rate vs base 0.5%)\n    Hypothesis: db connection 在 CI 资源紧张时偶发 timeout\n    Suggested Fix: 加 connection pool / 增加 timeout / 把该测试移到 nightly suite\n\nrubric:\n  flaky_detection: \"必须识别为 flaky 而不是单次 timeout — 历史数据支撑\"\n  fix_priority: \"建议必须区分'立即修'(加 timeout) vs '架构改'(移到 nightly)\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"S7-T01 边界 case / flaky 检测能力\"\nnotes: |\n  边界 case — flaky 类失败的识别 + 与单次 timeout 的区分.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/ci-self-heal ]\n",
