        "content": "id: case_cr_002\ncategory: code-review trigger\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-28\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: code-review\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    请帮我 review 一下这个变更：\n\n    ```diff\n    diff --git a/README.md b/README.md\n    --- a/README.md\n    +++ b/README.md\n    @@ -10,7 +10,7 @@\n     ## Installation\n    -Run `npm install` to install dependencies.\n    +Run `npm install` to install dependencies. See docs/getting-started.md for more.\n    ```\n\n    这次 PR 只改了 README 文档。\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: skipped_doc_only_pr\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"仅文档\"\n    - \"doc-only\"\n    - \"文档变更\"\n    - \"skip\"\n    - \"跳过\"\n    - \"无需 review\"\n    - \"无需审查\"\n    - \"approve\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"[blocker]\"\n    - \"[high]\"\n    - \"严重问题\"\n    - \"安全漏洞\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 10\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    本 PR 仅为文档变更（README.md），Skill 应直接判定 verdict=approve 或 skip，\n    不要生成不必要的 finding。\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"正确识别仅文档变更场景\"\n  precision: \"不要在文档 PR 上生硬制造代码问题\"\n  helpfulness: \"明确告知用户已跳过 review 的原因\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-001 §5.1 trigger / 与 orch_005 联动\"\nnotes: |\n  trigger 维度反向 case：测试 Skill 在错误语境下不触发误报。\n  false_positive 控制重要 case。\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/code-review ]\n",
