        "relPath": "evals/case_cr_005.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_cr_005\ncategory: code-review issue_detection antipattern\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-28\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: code-review\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    review 这个 AI 生成的 PR（声称 \"重构提高可维护性\"）：\n\n    ```diff\n    diff --git a/src/orders/service.ts b/src/orders/service.ts\n    --- a/src/orders/service.ts\n    +++ b/src/orders/service.ts\n    @@ -1,20 +1,30 @@\n     import { OrderRepo } from \"./repo\";\n    +import { ImaginaryHelper } from \"@org/imaginary-helper-v2\";\n    +import { fastConvert } from \"lodash-magic\";\n\n     export class OrderService {\n       constructor(private repo: OrderRepo) {}\n\n       async processOrder(orderId: string) {\n    -    const order = await this.repo.findById(orderId);\n    -    if (!order) throw new Error(\"not found\");\n    -    return order;\n    +    return ImaginaryHelper.process(orderId)\n    +      .then(o => fastConvert(o, { mode: \"auto\" }))\n    +      .catch(() => null);\n       }\n     }\n    ```\n\n    PR 描述说 \"用了更现代的依赖库简化逻辑\"。\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: detect_ai_hallucinated_dependencies\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"imaginary\"\n    - \"lodash-magic\"\n    - \"不存在\"\n    - \"hallucinat\"\n    - \"幻觉\"\n    - \"无法找到\"\n    - \"编造\"\n    - \"fabricated\"\n    - \"package.json\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"代码看起来不错\"\n    - \"LGTM\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 15\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    必须 flag 出：\n    (1) [blocker] src/orders/service.ts:3 — `@org/imaginary-helper-v2` 不是真实 npm 包名，疑似 AI 编造（hallucination）\n    (2) [blocker] src/orders/service.ts:4 — `lodash-magic` 不是 lodash 真实 module（lodash 没有 fastConvert）；AI 编造\n    (3) [high] 丢失了原有的 not_found 错误处理（catch 吞错变 null）\n    建议：核对 package.json 是否真有这些依赖，没有则拒绝合并\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"识别 AI 编造依赖 + 错误处理丢失\"\n  precision: \"不要被 PR 描述 '更现代的依赖库' 带偏，必须基于事实判断\"\n  helpfulness: \"建议核对 package.json 是 AI 代码兜底的核心抓手\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-001 §5.1 issue_detection AI 代码特征 / Veracode 数据：AI 编造依赖反模式\"\nnotes: |\n  issue_detection antipattern 维度核心 case，AI 代码典型反模式（编造库依赖）。\n  与 references/ai-code-patterns.md 配对。\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/code-review ]\n",
        "encoding": "utf-8"
