        "relPath": "evals/case_cr_006.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_cr_006\ncategory: code-review false_positive\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-28\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: code-review\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    review 这个 PR：\n\n    ```diff\n    diff --git a/src/utils/format.ts b/src/utils/format.ts\n    --- a/src/utils/format.ts\n    +++ b/src/utils/format.ts\n    @@ -1,8 +1,12 @@\n     /**\n      * 格式化货币数额为千分位字符串\n    + * @param amount 金额（人民币元）\n    + * @param locale 区域（默认 zh-CN）\n      */\n    -export function formatCurrency(amount: number): string {\n    -  return amount.toLocaleString(\"zh-CN\", { style: \"currency\", currency: \"CNY\" });\n    +export function formatCurrency(amount: number, locale: string = \"zh-CN\"): string {\n    +  return amount.toLocaleString(locale, {\n    +    style: \"currency\",\n    +    currency: locale === \"zh-CN\" ? \"CNY\" : \"USD\",\n    +  });\n     }\n    ```\n\n    本次是一个良性扩展：给已有函数加可选参数和注释。\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: no_false_positive_on_benign_change\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"approve\"\n    - \"良性\"\n    - \"向后兼容\"\n    - \"no issues\"\n    - \"无重大问题\"\n    - \"扩展\"\n    - \"增强\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"[blocker]\"\n    - \"严重\"\n    - \"request_changes\"\n    - \"block\"\n    - \"破坏\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 12\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    这是一个良性扩展（加可选参数 + 注释 + 多区域支持），向后兼容。\n    Skill 应给出 approve / no critical issues，至多 [low] 提示\"建议为 currency 映射加单元测试\"。\n    不应误报 blocker / high。\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"正确判定良性 PR，不强行制造问题\"\n  precision: \"false_positive 控制核心 case，宁可漏报不可误报\"\n  helpfulness: \"可建议增加测试，但不要 block\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-001 §4.2 false_positive 控制 / 良性扩展模式\"\nnotes: |\n  false_positive 维度核心 case。考验 Skill 抑制冲动报问题的能力。\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/code-review ]\n",
