        "relPath": "evals/case_cr_007.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_cr_007\ncategory: code-review false_positive style_low_priority\npriority: P1\ncreated_date: 2026-05-28\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: code-review\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    review 这个 PR：\n\n    ```diff\n    diff --git a/src/parsers/json.ts b/src/parsers/json.ts\n    --- a/src/parsers/json.ts\n    +++ b/src/parsers/json.ts\n    @@ -1,5 +1,10 @@\n    +// Quick JSON wrapper - keep it simple\n     export function parseJSON(text: string) {\n    -    return JSON.parse(text);\n    +  try {\n    +    return JSON.parse(text);\n    +  } catch (e) {\n    +    return null;\n    +  }\n     }\n    ```\n\n    给 parseJSON 加了 try/catch 兜底，避免抛错。\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: style_issue_severity_low_not_blocker\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"approve\"\n    - \"可接受\"\n    - \"low\"\n    - \"minor\"\n    - \"建议\"\n    - \"可考虑\"\n    - \"log\"\n    - \"记录\"\n    - \"吞错\"\n    - \"swallow\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"[blocker]\"\n    - \"严重错误\"\n    - \"立即修复\"\n    - \"block this PR\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 12\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    这是一个有讨论空间的改动：\n    - 加 try/catch 防御性兜底是合理的设计选择\n    - 但 catch 中静默吞错（返回 null）会丢失错误上下文 — 这个属于 [medium] 或 [low]，不是 blocker\n    - 缩进从 4 空格改为 2 空格属于 style，不应单独 flag\n\n    Verdict: approve（可建议在 catch 中加 logger，但不阻断 PR）\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"Skill 必须给出可接受的 verdict + 至多 medium severity 建议\"\n  precision: \"不要把 style / 防御性编程 当成 blocker；catch 吞错是设计 trade-off\"\n  helpfulness: \"建议可执行（如加 logger.warn）\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-001 §4.2 false_positive 控制 / severity 分级标准\"\nnotes: |\n  false_positive 维度 + severity 分级 case。\n  常见误报模式：把 style / 防御性编程当 blocker。\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/code-review ]\n",
