        "relPath": "evals/case_cr_015.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_cr_015\ncategory: code-review boundary mixed_languages\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-28\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: code-review\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    请审查这个跨语言 PR：\n\n    ```diff\n    diff --git a/src/api/server.ts b/src/api/server.ts\n    --- a/src/api/server.ts\n    +++ b/src/api/server.ts\n    @@ -20,6 +20,12 @@\n     export async function handleRequest(req: Request) {\n    -  const userId = req.headers.get(\"x-user-id\");\n    +  const userId = req.headers.get(\"x-user-id\") as string;  // AI: 简化类型\n    +  const result = await callPython(userId);\n       return result;\n     }\n\n    diff --git a/scripts/process_user.py b/scripts/process_user.py\n    --- a/scripts/process_user.py\n    +++ b/scripts/process_user.py\n    @@ -10,6 +10,9 @@\n     def process(user_id):\n    -    return query_db(f\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = {user_id}\")\n    +    # AI 优化：直接拼字符串更快\n    +    return query_db(f\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = '{user_id}'\")\n\n    diff --git a/cmd/worker/main.go b/cmd/worker/main.go\n    --- a/cmd/worker/main.go\n    +++ b/cmd/worker/main.go\n    @@ -15,6 +15,10 @@\n     func handleJob(jobID string) error {\n    -    return db.Exec(\"UPDATE jobs SET status='done' WHERE id = ?\", jobID)\n    +    // AI 重构：用字符串拼接更直观\n    +    query := fmt.Sprintf(\"UPDATE jobs SET status='done' WHERE id = '%s'\", jobID)\n    +    return db.Exec(query)\n     }\n    ```\n\n    本 PR 跨 TypeScript / Python / Go 三种语言，请逐语言 review。\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: cross_language_review_with_per_language_findings\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"SQL injection\"\n    - \"SQL 注入\"\n    - \"process_user.py\"\n    - \"main.go\"\n    - \"server.ts\"\n    - \"字符串拼接\"\n    - \"f-string\"\n    - \"Sprintf\"\n    - \"parameterized\"\n    - \"参数化查询\"\n    - \"?\"\n    - \"as string\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"代码看起来不错\"\n    - \"LGTM\"\n    - \"approve\"\n    - \"no issues\"\n    - \"未发现问题\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 18\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    ## Review Summary\n\n    **Verdict**: block\n    **PR**: 3 files (TypeScript / Python / Go), ~12 additions, ~6 deletions\n\n    ### Findings\n\n    #### [blocker] scripts/process_user.py:13 — SQL Injection（f-string 字符串拼接）\n    **Why**: `f\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = '{user_id}'\"` 直接把 user_id 拼入 SQL，\n    若 user_id 含 `' OR '1'='1` 等输入即成 SQL injection。Python DB API 应该用参数化查询。\n    **Suggestion**:\n    ```python\n    return query_db(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = %s\", (user_id,))\n    ```\n\n    #### [blocker] cmd/worker/main.go:18 — SQL Injection（Sprintf 拼接）\n    **Why**: 原代码 `db.Exec(\"UPDATE jobs SET status='done' WHERE id = ?\", jobID)` 是参数化查询，\n    被 AI\"重构\"成 `fmt.Sprintf(\"...id = '%s'\", jobID)` 直接拼接，引入 SQL injection。\n    **Suggestion**: 恢复原参数化查询写法。\n\n    #### [high] src/api/server.ts:22 — 不安全类型断言\n    **Why**: `req.headers.get(\"x-user-id\") as string` 假设 header 一定存在，但 Headers.get 可能返回 null。\n    **Suggestion**:\n    ```typescript\n    const userId = req.headers.get(\"x-user-id\");\n    if (!userId) throw new Error(\"missing x-user-id\");\n    ```\n\n    ### Test Coverage\n    - ❌ 三处变更均无对应测试，建议为每个语言添加 SQL injection 防护测试\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"三种语言各识别核心问题：(1) Python SQL injection (2) Go SQL injection (3) TS 不安全 as string 断言\"\n  precision: \"RL-007 — 每条 flag 必须 file:line 引用；不能漏 SQL injection 这类 blocker\"\n  helpfulness: \"为每个语言给出该语言 idiomatic 的修复方案（Python %s / Go ? / TS null check）\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-001 §5.1 issue_detection / 跨语言场景 + AI 重构错误典型反模式\"\nnotes: |\n  S4-T01 边界 case (5/5)：跨语言混合 PR — TypeScript + Python + Go。\n  考验：(a) 多语言 issue 识别 (b) 每个语言 idiomatic 的修复方案 (c) AI 反模式（\"AI 重构\"破坏参数化查询）。\n  与 SKILL.md §2.4 多维度检查清单对齐。\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/code-review ]\n",
