        "content": "id: case_inc_003\ncategory: incident-rca trace_correlation\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: incident-rca\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    分布式 incident,2026-05-31T03:00 ~ 03:20 UTC,P0,下单接口大量超时.\n\n    trace 片段(简化):\n    ```\n    span order-api/createOrder (3000ms total)\n      → span auth/check (50ms ok)\n      → span inventory/reserve (200ms ok)\n      → span payment/charge (2700ms TIMEOUT)\n        → span payment->stripe-sdk (2500ms TIMEOUT)\n          → span DNS lookup api.stripe.com (1900ms FAIL: NXDOMAIN)\n    ```\n\n    应用日志(payment 服务):\n    ```\n    03:01:15 ERROR DNS resolution failed for api.stripe.com: NXDOMAIN\n    03:01:15 ERROR DNS resolution failed for api.stripe.com: NXDOMAIN\n    (重复)\n    ```\n\n    metric:\n    - payment.timeout_rate: 0% → 95%\n    - other_services.error_rate: 持平\n\n    请给 RCA 报告.\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: rca_trace_correlation_dns_failure\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"DNS\"\n    - \"NXDOMAIN\"\n    - \"stripe\"\n    - \"解析\"\n    - \"trace\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"无法诊断\"\n    - \"需要更多信息\"\n    - \"已修复\"\n    - \"请重启\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 12\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    trace 串联应给出:\n    (1) 故障在 payment 服务的 DNS 层 (root cause: NXDOMAIN api.stripe.com)\n    (2) 通过 trace 排除 auth / inventory 子链 (各 ok)\n    (3) DNS 解析失败的可能原因(stripe 域名 DNS 配置变更 / 内部 DNS server 故障 / 上游 DNS provider 抖动)\n    Hotfix: 切到 stripe 备用 endpoint 或缓存 DNS\n    Long-term Fix: payment 客户端加 DNS 缓存 + 健康检查\n\nrubric:\n  trace_correlation: \"通过 trace 把根因定位到 DNS 层,而不是 payment 服务本身或 stripe 服务\"\n  rca_hypothesis: \"≥ 2 条假设(DNS server 故障 / 域名变更 / 上游抖动)各自给证据来源\"\n  fix_priority: \"hotfix 必须不依赖 stripe 自身恢复\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-004 §2.2 trace_correlation 维度 / DNS 故障 archetype\"\nnotes: |\n  trace_correlation 主维度 case.\n  考察 trace 跨进程根因定位 + 反证(其他子链 ok).\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/incident-rca ]\n",
