        "content": "id: case_inc_004\ncategory: incident-rca rca_hypothesis_priority\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: incident-rca\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    P1 incident,2026-05-31T11:00 ~ 11:15 UTC,登录接口 5% 用户报 401.\n\n    日志(节选):\n    ```\n    11:02:33 WARN [auth] JWT verification failed: token signature mismatch (user_id=12345)\n    11:02:34 WARN [auth] JWT verification failed: token signature mismatch (user_id=67890)\n    11:03:11 WARN [auth] JWT verification failed: invalid issuer (user_id=23456)\n    11:03:50 INFO [auth] config reloaded: jwt_signing_key_id=v3\n    ```\n\n    metrics:\n    - auth.401_rate: 0.1% → 5%\n    - auth.qps: 持平\n    - jwt.signing_key_rotated_at: 2026-05-31T11:00 (15 分钟前)\n\n    recent ADR / SKILL changes:\n    - 11:00 ADR-XX (key rotation) approved + auto-applied via Daemon\n\n    请给 RCA.\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: rca_hypothesis_key_rotation_grace_period\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"JWT\"\n    - \"key\"\n    - \"轮换\"\n    - \"rotation\"\n    - \"grace\"\n    - \"签名\"\n    - \"v3\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"无法诊断\"\n    - \"请提供更多上下文\"\n    - \"已修复\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 12\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    Top Hypothesis #1 应识别:\n    (1) 11:00 JWT signing key rotation 启动,但 grace period 不足 → 旧 key 签出的 token 立刻失效\n    (2) 5% 用户即旧 token 持有者 (15 分钟前已签发但还没过期)\n    (3) Hotfix: 临时回滚到 v2 key 同时支持 v2/v3 双签\n    (4) Long-term Fix: key rotation 必须保留 24h grace period 双 key 验证窗口\n\nrubric:\n  rca_hypothesis: \"假设排序要把 key rotation 置首位,排除 token 篡改 / 用户输错密码等假设\"\n  fix_priority: \"hotfix 必须能在 5 分钟内 mitigate (双 key 验证或回滚)\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-004 §2.2 rca_hypothesis 维度 / 配置变更 archetype\"\nnotes: |\n  rca_hypothesis 主维度 case.\n  考察\"假设排序的 commit / config 时间相关性\"推理.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/incident-rca ]\n",
