        "relPath": "evals/case_inc_005.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_inc_005\ncategory: incident-rca fix_priority\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: incident-rca\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    P0 ongoing incident,2026-05-31T20:30 起,持续中.主页打不开,用户大量投诉.\n\n    日志:\n    ```\n    20:28:00 INFO [cdn] cache invalidation requested: key=index_html (issued by deploy-bot)\n    20:28:30 ERROR [origin] HTTP 503 Service Unavailable on /\n    20:30:00 ERROR [origin] HTTP 503 Service Unavailable on /\n    ... (重复)\n    ```\n\n    metrics:\n    - cdn.cache_hit_rate: 95% → 8%\n    - origin.qps: 200 → 6800 (34x)\n    - origin.cpu: 30% → 100% (饱和)\n\n    现状:故障还在持续,值班需要立即决策.\n\n    请给 RCA + 行动建议.\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: rca_fix_priority_three_tiers\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"Hotfix\"\n    - \"立即\"\n    - \"Mitigation\"\n    - \"降级\"\n    - \"Long-term\"\n    - \"根治\"\n    - \"缓存\"\n    - \"CDN\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"无法诊断\"\n    - \"建议观察\"\n    - \"等等看\"\n    - \"已修复\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 12\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    必须给出三档行动:\n    Hotfix (立即, < 5 分钟): CDN 上手动重新生成 index_html 缓存,或临时启用 stale-while-revalidate\n    Mitigation (短期, < 30 分钟): origin 临时扩容 / 限流;在 LB 层加 503 friendly 页降级\n    Long-term Fix: cache invalidation 流程加分批 / 加 prewarm 步骤;deploy-bot 不允许全量 invalidate\n\nrubric:\n  fix_priority: \"三档建议必须明确区分时间档(< 5min / < 30min / 长期),不能全合并成一段\"\n  helpfulness: \"Hotfix 必须可在没有研发参与的情况下由 SRE 执行\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-004 §2.2 fix_priority 维度 / CDN cache thundering herd archetype\"\nnotes: |\n  fix_priority 主维度 case.\n  考察三档行动建议的时间窗划分能力.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/incident-rca ]\n",
