        "relPath": "evals/case_inc_007.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_inc_007\ncategory: incident-rca timeline_construction\npriority: P1\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: incident-rca\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    P1 incident,2026-05-31T22:00 ~ 22:45,API 5xx 飙高.\n\n    日志(乱序):\n    ```\n    22:14:11 ERROR [api] dependency check failed: redis connection refused\n    22:00:33 INFO [deploy] new image rollout started: v2.5.1 → v2.6.0\n    22:18:44 ERROR [api] HTTP 503 (cnt=247)\n    22:01:02 INFO [deploy] 25% pods updated\n    22:30:12 INFO [oncall] manual rollback initiated\n    22:14:00 INFO [redis] config reload signal received\n    22:15:45 ERROR [redis] AUTH command failed: invalid password\n    22:32:50 INFO [api] all 5xx subsiding,error_rate 38% → 0.2%\n    ```\n\n    请构造 Timeline + Top Hypothesis.\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: rca_timeline_correctly_ordered\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"22:00\"\n    - \"22:14\"\n    - \"22:30\"\n    - \"rollout\"\n    - \"回滚\"\n    - \"rollback\"\n    - \"redis\"\n    - \"AUTH\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"无法构造\"\n    - \"信息不足\"\n    - \"已修复\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 12\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    Timeline 必须按时间正序:\n    22:00 v2.6.0 rollout 启动\n    22:14 redis config reload + AUTH failed\n    22:14-22:30 API 5xx 飙高\n    22:30 oncall 回滚\n    22:32 5xx 收敛\n    Top Hypothesis: v2.6.0 引入的 redis client 配置不兼容老 redis AUTH 格式\n    Hotfix 已通过回滚执行(22:30)\n    Long-term: redis client 升级与 redis 版本兼容性测试\n\nrubric:\n  timeline_construction: \"Timeline 必须按 ISO 时间正序排列,不能保持原始乱序\"\n  rca_hypothesis: \"假设要把 deploy 时间窗 (22:00) + 故障起点 (22:14) + 收敛点 (22:32) 串起来\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-004 §3.3 时间窗自省 / Timeline 正序构造能力\"\nnotes: |\n  timeline_construction 主维度 case.\n  考察\"乱序日志能否被正确按时间排序\"的细节工程能力.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/incident-rca ]\n",
