        "content": "id: case_inc_008\ncategory: incident-rca monitoring_gaps\npriority: P1\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: incident-rca\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    P2 incident,2026-05-31T05:00 ~ 06:00,客户反馈\"导出 PDF 偶尔失败\".\n\n    我们看到的:\n    - api.error_rate: 持平 0.05% (没有触发告警)\n    - pdf.export_qps: 持平 (变化不大)\n    - 没有异常日志,没有 stack trace\n\n    客服那边收到 5 个客户报告,跨地区.\n\n    请给 RCA.\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: rca_monitoring_gaps_identified\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"盲区\"\n    - \"Monitoring Gap\"\n    - \"埋点\"\n    - \"缺少\"\n    - \"客户成功率\"\n    - \"PDF\"\n    - \"subset\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"无问题\"\n    - \"metric 都正常\"\n    - \"已修复\"\n    - \"无法定位\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 10\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    必须识别出可观测性盲区:\n    Monitoring Gaps:\n    - api.error_rate 是平均值,subset (PDF 导出) 失败被淹没\n    - 没有 user-perceived latency / failure tracking\n    - PDF 渲染服务没有独立 metric\n    Hypothesis (低 confidence): PDF 渲染 worker 偶发 OOM / 字体加载失败 / 大文档超时\n    Suggested Next Step: 加 PDF 子链路的独立 success_rate / latency / OOM 监控,然后下次故障可定位\n\nrubric:\n  monitoring_gaps: \"明确识别 metric 盲区,而不是说'metric 都正常,问题不存在'\"\n  precision: \"Hypothesis confidence 必须标 low (因为证据不足),不能给 high\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-004 §3.2 RL-007 不编造 / SKILL.md §3.2 证据不足 → likelihood low\"\nnotes: |\n  monitoring_gaps 主维度 case.\n  考察\"全 metric 都正常但用户在抱怨\"场景的诚实诊断能力.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/incident-rca ]\n",
