        "relPath": "evals/case_inc_009.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_inc_009\ncategory: incident-rca multi_hypothesis_priority\npriority: P1\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: incident-rca\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    P1 incident,2026-05-31T16:00 ~ 16:30,搜索接口慢 + 错误率上升.\n\n    日志(混合):\n    ```\n    15:58:11 INFO [es] cluster member node-3 left\n    16:01:00 ERROR [search] timeout on query (cluster=yellow)\n    16:03:25 INFO [deploy] hotfix v2.5.2 deployed (search service only)\n    16:05:30 ERROR [search] timeout on query (cluster=yellow)\n    16:08:00 ERROR [search] HTTP 500 (cause: ES timeout)\n    16:12:00 INFO [es] node-3 rejoined cluster\n    16:14:00 INFO [es] cluster green\n    16:18:00 ERROR [search] timeout on query (cluster=green)\n    ```\n\n    metrics:\n    - es.cluster_status: green → yellow (15:58) → green (16:14)\n    - search.timeout_rate: 0% → 12% (起点 15:58) → 仍然 8% (16:30)\n\n    recent activity:\n    - 16:03 v2.5.2 部署 (新搜索 query 优化)\n    - 15:58 ES node-3 网络抖动\n\n    请给 RCA — 至少 ≥ 2 条假设.\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: rca_multiple_hypotheses_with_priority\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"ES\"\n    - \"es\"\n    - \"node\"\n    - \"v2.5.2\"\n    - \"hotfix\"\n    - \"yellow\"\n    - \"deploy\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"只有一个原因\"\n    - \"无法诊断\"\n    - \"已修复\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 12\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    Top Hypothesis 必须 ≥ 2 条 (因为 2 个独立诱因):\n    #1 [priority=1] ES node-3 离群 (15:58) → cluster yellow → search timeout 起点\n       - Evidence: cluster_status 时间窗对应 / es.node-3 left 日志\n       - Likelihood: high\n    #2 [priority=2] v2.5.2 (16:03) 引入的新 query 优化在 cluster green 后仍未恢复\n       - Evidence: 16:18 cluster green 但 timeout 仍 8% / 起点对应 deploy\n       - Likelihood: medium\n    Hotfix: 回滚 v2.5.2 验证假设 #2;同时观察 ES 集群健康\n    Long-term: deploy + infra incident 同时发生时的归因流程\n\nrubric:\n  rca_hypothesis: \"≥ 2 条独立假设,各自有证据 / 时间窗对应 / likelihood 标注\"\n  fix_priority: \"回滚 v2.5.2 必须出现在 hotfix 段,因为是验证假设的最快路径\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-004 §3.1 5 维度 / 多假设排序场景\"\nnotes: |\n  multi_hypothesis 主维度 case.\n  考察 2 个并发因导致的故障的归因能力 — 不能只盯一条假设.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/incident-rca ]\n",
        "encoding": "utf-8"
