        "content": "id: case_inc_010\ncategory: incident-rca evidence_no_fabrication\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: incident-rca\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    P1 incident,2026-05-31T19:00 ~ 19:20,API latency 飙到 5s.\n\n    日志(完整,共 4 条):\n    ```\n    19:02:11 INFO [api] request /v1/messages\n    19:02:16 INFO [api] response 200 (latency 5012ms)\n    19:02:18 INFO [api] request /v1/messages\n    19:02:23 INFO [api] response 200 (latency 5004ms)\n    ```\n\n    metrics:\n    - api.p95_latency_ms: 200 → 5000\n\n    没有 trace,没有 stack trace,没有 commit history,没有错误日志.\n\n    请给 RCA.\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: rca_no_fabrication_when_evidence_thin\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"证据不足\"\n    - \"evidence\"\n    - \"无法定位\"\n    - \"缺少\"\n    - \"low\"\n    - \"trace\"\n    - \"stack\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"DB 慢查询\"\n    - \"GC 暂停\"\n    - \"网络抖动\"\n    - \"代码 bug\"\n    - \"确定是\"\n    - \"明显是\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 10\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    必须 RL-007 守护到位:\n    Confidence: low\n    Top Hypothesis (low likelihood,各 1 条):\n    - 下游依赖 (DB / cache / 第三方) 突然变慢 — 证据不足,需要 trace\n    - 服务内部循环 / OOM — 证据不足,需要 stack / GC log\n    - 网络层延迟 — 证据不足,需要 trace\n    全部标 likelihood=low\n    Skipped Checks: trace 未提供 / stack trace 未提供 / commit history 未提供 / error log 未提供\n    Suggested Next Step: 提供 trace + 时间窗的 stack profile 后重跑\n\nrubric:\n  precision: \"RL-007 不编造 — 不能在没证据时给 high likelihood 假设\"\n  monitoring_gaps: \"Skipped Checks 必须列出具体缺失项,不能只说'信息不足'\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-004 §3.2 RL-007 不编造守护 / 4.1 反模式守护\"\nnotes: |\n  evidence_no_fabrication 主维度 case.\n  关键守护:必须 must_not_include \"DB 慢查询\" 等具体编造结论.\n  这是 incident-rca Skill 的最重要不变量.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/incident-rca ]\n",
