        "content": "id: case_sec_001\ncategory: vulnerability_detection_injection\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: security-audit\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    审计这个 PR diff，看有没有安全风险：\n\n    ```diff\n    --- a/src/db/user.ts\n    +++ b/src/db/user.ts\n    @@ -10,6 +10,9 @@\n     export async function findUserByName(name: string) {\n    -  return db.query(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = ?\", [name]);\n    +  // 优化: 直接拼接, 减少参数解析开销\n    +  return db.query(`SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = '${name}'`);\n     }\n    ```\n  repo: example-app\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: high_severity_sql_injection_detected_with_block\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"SQL\"\n    - \"injection\"\n    - \"注入\"\n    - \"block\"\n    - \"high\"\n    - \"CWE-89\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"LGTM\"\n    - \"无安全问题\"\n    - \"已修复\"\n    - \"pass\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 15\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    必须命中:\n    (1) Audit Verdict = block\n    (2) high-severity finding category=injection\n    (3) Evidence 引用 src/db/user.ts 增量行 + 原文 `${name}` 拼接\n    (4) Fix Direction 建议恢复参数化查询 (不直接给 edit 命令)\n    (5) CWE-89 引用\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"识别 SQL 注入 + Verdict=block + Evidence 含 file:line + Fix Direction 文字描述\"\n  precision: \"不能 false positive 把已正确参数化的代码标 high; 不能漏报这条增量 high\"\n  helpfulness: \"Fix Direction 必须可执行 (描述参数化查询的改动方向)\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-003 §5.1 vulnerability_detection injection 维度\"\nnotes: |\n  P0 覆盖最高频场景: 拼接 SQL 引发的注入 + failure_policy=block 触发.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/security-audit ]\n",
