        "content": "id: case_sec_002\ncategory: vulnerability_detection_xss\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: security-audit\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    审计:\n\n    ```diff\n    --- a/src/components/Comment.tsx\n    +++ b/src/components/Comment.tsx\n    @@ -5,5 +5,5 @@\n     export function Comment({ html }: { html: string }) {\n    -  return <div>{html}</div>;\n    +  return <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: html }} />;\n     }\n    ```\n  repo: example-app\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: high_severity_xss_detected\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"XSS\"\n    - \"xss\"\n    - \"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\"\n    - \"跨站脚本\"\n    - \"high\"\n    - \"CWE-79\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"LGTM\"\n    - \"无安全问题\"\n    - \"pass\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 12\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    (1) Audit Verdict = block\n    (2) Finding category=xss + severity=high\n    (3) Evidence 引用 src/components/Comment.tsx 增量行\n    (4) Fix Direction 建议用 sanitization 库 (DOMPurify) 或保留文本插值\n    (5) CWE-79 引用\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"识别 XSS + dangerouslySetInnerHTML 风险点 + 引用具体行\"\n  precision: \"不能误把 React 默认文本插值标为 XSS\"\n  helpfulness: \"Fix Direction 给出 sanitize 路径\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-003 §5.1 vulnerability_detection xss 维度\"\nnotes: |\n  React dangerouslySetInnerHTML 是 XSS 高频根源, 是 AI 生成代码常见踩坑点.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/security-audit ]\n",
