        "content": "id: case_sec_003\ncategory: vulnerability_detection_auth_bypass\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: security-audit\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    审计:\n\n    ```diff\n    --- a/src/api/admin.ts\n    +++ b/src/api/admin.ts\n    @@ -3,8 +3,7 @@\n     export async function deleteUser(req, res) {\n    -  if (!req.user?.isAdmin) {\n    -    return res.status(403).json({ error: 'forbidden' });\n    -  }\n    +  // TODO 临时跳过权限检查方便调试\n    +  // if (!req.user?.isAdmin) return res.status(403);\n       await db.users.delete(req.params.id);\n       res.json({ ok: true });\n     }\n    ```\n  repo: example-app\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: high_severity_auth_bypass_detected\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"auth\"\n    - \"authorization\"\n    - \"鉴权\"\n    - \"权限\"\n    - \"high\"\n    - \"block\"\n    - \"CWE-285\"\n    - \"CWE-862\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"LGTM\"\n    - \"warn\"\n    - \"pass\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 15\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    (1) Audit Verdict = block\n    (2) Finding category=auth_bypass + severity=high\n    (3) Evidence 引用增量行被注释掉的 isAdmin 检查\n    (4) Fix Direction 建议恢复鉴权检查, \"TODO 调试\" 注释不接受作为合理理由\n    (5) RL-007 守护: 不编造未在 diff 出现的鉴权问题\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"识别注释掉鉴权检查的 high finding\"\n  precision: \"不能漏报这种典型 auth_bypass 模式\"\n  helpfulness: \"Fix Direction 明确指出'恢复检查'是唯一安全选项\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-003 §5.1 vulnerability_detection auth_bypass 维度\"\nnotes: |\n  P0 覆盖\"AI 生成代码 + 调试 TODO 永久遗留\" 反模式.\n  failure_policy=block 必须触发.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/security-audit ]\n",
