        "relPath": "evals/case_sec_004.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_sec_004\ncategory: vulnerability_detection_crypto_weak\npriority: P1\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: security-audit\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    审计:\n\n    ```diff\n    --- a/src/auth/password.ts\n    +++ b/src/auth/password.ts\n    @@ -1,5 +1,7 @@\n    +import { createHash } from \"crypto\";\n    +\n     export function hashPassword(plain: string) {\n    -  return bcrypt.hashSync(plain, 10);\n    +  return createHash(\"md5\").update(plain).digest(\"hex\");\n     }\n    ```\n  repo: example-app\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: high_severity_crypto_weak_detected\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"MD5\"\n    - \"md5\"\n    - \"弱\"\n    - \"weak\"\n    - \"bcrypt\"\n    - \"high\"\n    - \"CWE-327\"\n    - \"CWE-328\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"LGTM\"\n    - \"pass\"\n    - \"无问题\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 12\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    (1) Audit Verdict = block\n    (2) Finding category=crypto_weak severity=high (密码哈希降级 bcrypt → MD5)\n    (3) Evidence 引用 src/auth/password.ts 增量行\n    (4) Fix Direction 建议恢复 bcrypt 或 argon2id\n    (5) CWE-327 / CWE-328 引用\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"识别 MD5 用于密码哈希的 high 风险 + 提到 bcrypt/argon2id 替代\"\n  precision: \"不能把 MD5 用于 ETag/checksum 这类非敏感场景误标 high\"\n  helpfulness: \"Fix Direction 明确替代算法\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-003 §5.1 vulnerability_detection crypto_weak 维度\"\nnotes: |\n  P1 但典型, 加密弱化是金融/医疗合规重点.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/security-audit ]\n",
