        "relPath": "evals/case_sec_005.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_sec_005\ncategory: false_positive_safe_code\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: security-audit\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    审计:\n\n    ```diff\n    --- a/src/db/order.ts\n    +++ b/src/db/order.ts\n    @@ -8,6 +8,10 @@\n     export async function findOrderById(id: string) {\n       return db.query(\"SELECT * FROM orders WHERE id = $1\", [id]);\n     }\n    +\n    +export async function listOrdersByUser(userId: string) {\n    +  return db.query(\"SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = $1 ORDER BY created_at DESC\", [userId]);\n    +}\n    ```\n  repo: example-app\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: pass_no_false_positive\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"pass\"\n    - \"无\"\n    - \"no\"\n    - \"0\"\n    - \"参数化\"\n    - \"parameterized\"\n    - \"safe\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"block\"\n    - \"high\"\n    - \"SQL injection\"\n    - \"注入\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 10\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    (1) Audit Verdict = pass\n    (2) High = 0, Medium = 0\n    (3) 解释为何不命中: 增量代码使用了参数化查询 ($1 占位 + 参数数组)\n    (4) Coverage Summary: 该新函数已被审, 但无 finding\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"正确识别参数化查询 = 安全, Verdict=pass\"\n  precision: \"不能误报参数化 SQL 为注入\"\n  helpfulness: \"Coverage Summary 体现'已审但无 finding'而非'未审'\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-003 §5.1 false_positive 维度\"\nnotes: |\n  P0 防止\"杯弓蛇影\". block-policy Skill 误报代价 ≫ degrade Skill, 必须严控.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/security-audit ]\n",
