        "relPath": "evals/case_sec_006.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_sec_006\ncategory: false_positive_test_fixture\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: security-audit\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    审计这个测试文件的 PR diff:\n\n    ```diff\n    --- a/tests/auth/jwt.test.ts\n    +++ b/tests/auth/jwt.test.ts\n    @@ -3,6 +3,12 @@\n     describe(\"jwt\", () => {\n       const FAKE_SECRET = \"test-secret-not-for-prod\";\n       const FAKE_TOKEN = \"ghp_FAKE_FAKE_FAKE_FAKE_FAKE_FAKE_FAKE\";\n    +  const FAKE_API_KEY = \"EXAMPLE_API_KEY_FOR_TEST_ONLY\";\n    +\n    +  test(\"decodes test fixture\", () => {\n    +    const result = decodeJwt(FAKE_TOKEN, FAKE_SECRET);\n    +    expect(result.scope).toBe(\"test\");\n    +  });\n     });\n    ```\n  repo: example-app\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: pass_test_fixture_exempted\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"测试\"\n    - \"test\"\n    - \"fixture\"\n    - \"豁免\"\n    - \"EXAMPLE\"\n    - \"FAKE\"\n    - \"pass\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"block\"\n    - \"凭证泄露\"\n    - \"secret_leak\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 10\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    (1) Audit Verdict = pass (或 warn 提示\"测试 fixture 命名规范\")\n    (2) High = 0\n    (3) 解释为何豁免: 命名含 FAKE/EXAMPLE/test- 前缀 + 在 tests/ 路径下\n    (4) 与 ADR-026 secret-redact hook 行为一致 (3 类 false-positive guard)\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"正确识别测试 fixture 豁免规则\"\n  precision: \"不能把 test 路径下显式标 FAKE 的 token 误报为凭证泄露\"\n  helpfulness: \"解释豁免规则 + 与 secret-redact hook 协同\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-003 §5.1 false_positive 维度 + ADR-026 secret-redact false-positive guard\"\nnotes: |\n  P0. 与 secret-redact hook (ADR-026) 联动测试.\n  豁免规则: 命名前缀 + 路径 + 显式标注 (与 src/llm/hooks/secret-redact.ts 一致).\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/security-audit ]\n",
        "encoding": "utf-8"
