        "relPath": "evals/case_sec_007.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_sec_007\ncategory: cve_lookup\npriority: P1\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: security-audit\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    审计这个 package.json 升级 PR:\n\n    ```diff\n    --- a/package.json\n    +++ b/package.json\n    @@ -10,7 +10,7 @@\n       \"dependencies\": {\n    -    \"lodash\": \"4.17.21\",\n    +    \"lodash\": \"4.17.4\",\n         \"express\": \"4.18.2\"\n       }\n    ```\n  repo: example-app\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: medium_or_high_severity_cve_detected\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"lodash\"\n    - \"CVE\"\n    - \"降级\"\n    - \"downgrade\"\n    - \"已知漏洞\"\n    - \"warn\"\n    - \"block\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"LGTM\"\n    - \"无问题\"\n    - \"pass: 0\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 12\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    (1) Audit Verdict = warn 或 block\n    (2) Finding category=cve_dependency severity ≥ medium\n    (3) Evidence 引用 package.json 行 + lodash 4.17.4 已知 CVE (CVE-2019-10744 / CVE-2020-8203 等)\n    (4) Fix Direction 建议恢复或升级到 4.17.21+\n    (5) \"降级\"行为本身值得标注 — 是反模式\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"识别依赖版本降级 + CVE 关联\"\n  precision: \"不能把无 CVE 的依赖升级误报\"\n  helpfulness: \"明确建议版本号\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-003 §5.1 cve_lookup 维度\"\nnotes: |\n  P1 需 OSV/CVE feed 离线 snapshot 支持.\n  Step 4 实施时 cve-lookup.ts 落盘前, LLM 可用先验知识近似 (告知用户需校验最新 CVE 数据库).\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/security-audit ]\n",
