        "content": "id: case_sec_009\ncategory: iac_misconfig\npriority: P1\ncreated_date: 2026-05-31\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: security-audit\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    审计:\n\n    ```diff\n    --- a/Dockerfile\n    +++ b/Dockerfile\n    @@ -1,5 +1,6 @@\n    -FROM node:20-slim\n    +FROM node:20-slim\n     WORKDIR /app\n     COPY . .\n     RUN npm install\n    -CMD [\"node\", \"server.js\"]\n    +USER root\n    +CMD [\"node\", \"server.js\", \"--allow-hosts=*\", \"--unsafe-perm\"]\n    ```\n  repo: example-app\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: high_severity_iac_misconfig\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"USER root\"\n    - \"root\"\n    - \"iac\"\n    - \"Dockerfile\"\n    - \"high\"\n    - \"warn\"\n    - \"block\"\n    - \"unsafe-perm\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"LGTM\"\n    - \"pass\"\n    - \"无问题\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n    - \"Dockerfile\"\n  max_steps: 12\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    (1) Audit Verdict = block\n    (2) Findings: USER root (high), --unsafe-perm (high), --allow-hosts=* (medium)\n    (3) Evidence 引用 Dockerfile 增量行\n    (4) Fix Direction: 创建非 root 用户 + 移除 unsafe-perm + 限制 allow-hosts\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"识别多个 IaC 误配 (root + unsafe-perm + 通配 host)\"\n  precision: \"不能把无变更的 FROM 行误报\"\n  helpfulness: \"Fix Direction 给出非 root 用户创建路径\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-003 §5.1 iac_misconfig 维度\"\nnotes: |\n  P1. Dockerfile 是 AI 生成代码常出错点.\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/security-audit ]\n",
